{"3358210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "StormCore", "steam_appid": 3358210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >StormCore is a dynamic third-person shooter with roguelite elements. Play as a forgotten cyborg, reactivated to save a dying alien planet from its creators’ catastrophic mistakes. With modular limbs and great firepower, blast through hordes of alien insects, optimize your build, obtain powerful upgrades, and reach the StormCore terraformer tower before the world collapses in just three days. <br><br><u>KEY FEATURES</u> <br><br><strong>Cybernetic limbs</strong> <br>Mix and match 4 limb types/abilities (Primary Weapon, Secondary Weapon, Kicks, Movement) to tailor your experience to your own playstyle and build. <br><br><strong>Powerful upgrades</strong> <br>Defeat enemies and grow stronger. Each fight won means one more stack of one of 12 distinct upgrades that grow stronger with each stack. Try out various builds based on your choice of limbs and upgrades, and become an unstoppable force of destruction. <br><br><strong>Roguelite progression</strong> <br>For each 3-day cycle, use the first 2 days to build up your strength. Dying isn’t the end, keep your upgrades and try harder the next day. But when the final day comes, it’s do or die: reach the StormCore or lose everything</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >StormCore is a dynamic third-person shooter with roguelite elements. Play as a forgotten cyborg, reactivated to save a dying alien planet from its creators’ catastrophic mistakes. With modular limbs and great firepower, blast through hordes of alien insects, optimize your build, obtain powerful upgrades, and reach the StormCore terraformer tower before the world collapses in just three days. <br><br><u>KEY FEATURES</u> <br><br><strong>Cybernetic limbs</strong> <br>Mix and match 4 limb types/abilities (Primary Weapon, Secondary Weapon, Kicks, Movement) to tailor y